# Symlinks under this directory are rebuilt at every SessionStart by
# skill-provisioner.sh sync, which reads the persona's DB assignments
# (asset_agency_skills + asset_agency_skill_assignments) and lays them
# down pointing at $AGENCY_OS_REPO/$skill_path. They are ephemeral
# per-machine state, not source of truth. See WO-2026-193.
*
!.gitignore
